# Source and submitted tender documents are NOT committed.
#
# This repository is currently PUBLIC on GitHub. Real tender documents contain
# staff names and contact details, client referee names and emails, tax
# reference numbers, insurance details, contract values and pricing — none of
# which should be published. Anything pushed here is public immediately and may
# be cached or indexed even if deleted afterwards.
#
# Keep the real documents in OneDrive/SharePoint. This folder holds only the
# templates, process and reusable writing guidance.

# Office and PDF documents anywhere under tenders/
*.docx
*.doc
*.dotx
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
*.zip
*.msg
*.eml

# Bid working folders
active/*/
archive/*/
won/*/

# Allow the templates and the folder READMEs back in
!templates/
!templates/**
!active/README.md
!archive/README.md
!won/README.md
